# Dual remotes — youjune (origin) + sewon

When the user asks to commit and/or push this repo:

- Remotes: `origin` = `https://github.com/youjune2005/umbrella.git`, `sewon` = `https://github.com/sewon202/umbrella.git`.
- After a successful local commit, push the same branch to **both** `origin` and `sewon` unless the user explicitly asks for only one.
- Keep `main` tracking `origin/main` (do not leave upstream on `sewon` after `git push -u sewon`).
- Do not commit `umbrella.db`.
- Still follow authorship rules: Youjune Park only; never Cursor `Co-authored-by`.
